      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market comes this charming terrace property in a mature residential area of Fermoy Town.  Presented in good condition, the property is ready for immediate occupation.  Extending to c. 806 sq. feet, the property boasts an open living/kitchen area, utility and bathroom on ground floor level with three bedrooms on first floor.  This property is tailor made for first time buyers or investors  and is sure to appeal to all sectors of the market.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room\t\r\n4.08m x 3.18m\t\r\nTimber floor, power points, T.V. point, recessed ceiling lights, radiator.\r\n\r\nKitchen \r\n2.93m x 2.48m\t\r\nTile floor, floor and eye level units, integrated electric hob, tile splashback, power points, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nUtility\t\r\n2.48m x 1.13m\t\r\nTile floor, power points, plumbed for washing machine, access to rear.\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\r\n2.41m x 2.00m\t\r\nTile floor, bath/shower unit, W.C., W.H.B., radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n4.08m x 3.17m\t\r\nCarpet floor, power points, radiator, fitted wardrobe, T.V. point.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n2.57m x 2.59m\t\r\nTimber floor, power points, radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom\t\r\n3.63m x 2.38m\t\r\nCarpet floor, power points, radiator.\r\n\r\nServices:\t\r\nMains Water\r\nMains Sewerage\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\t\r\n\r\nEircode:  P61 DC53"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Excellent location within walking distance of all town amenities.\r\n-Good condition throughout, ready for immediate occupation.  \r\n-Private rear garden with block-built garden shed.\r\n-Enclosed front garden with potential for off-street parking.\r\n-Oil fired central heating.  \r\n-P.V.C. double glazed windows throughout.\r\n-Sold with appliances and furniture included."
      },
